      "content": "Hey, I've got these raw transcripts from a few customer calls that we need to turn into formal training docs for the new hires. They're a bit of a mess right now. Can you take a look at this first one and rewrite it into proper, polished business English so it looks professional in the manual?\n\nTranscript:\n\"Customer: Yo, I been tryin to get my refund for like two weeks now. I called up last Tuesday and nobody ever called me back. Like, I'm really frustrated right now cause the money just ain't showin up in my account yet. Can y'all check on that for me?\"",
